# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/

# NOTE: expo-env.d.ts is deliberately NOT ignored, despite the note Expo writes
# inside it. It is what declares `*.css` for the `global.css` import in
# app/_layout.tsx, and it is only regenerated by `expo start` — leaving it out
# means `npm run typecheck` fails on a fresh clone and in CI. It is three
# stable lines; Expo rewrites it identically, so it produces no diff churn.

